  "format": "adts1.<payload>.<sig>; payload = base64url without padding of the bytes tenant|expiry|subject (expiry = now + ttl, unix seconds in decimal; ttl <= 0 means default_ttl_seconds; subject cut to at most max_subject_bytes without splitting a UTF-8 character, then a | in tenant or subject is refused); sig = base64url without padding of HMAC-SHA256(secret, payload as written). Verify: trim the token, three parts, prefix adts1, constant-time signature check, payload decodes (no padding), split into at most three fields on |, expiry a decimal integer, then expired only when now > expiry.",
